{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1167.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"3174154ff0784cbe80147f666a2280aa4d1a4bdc011826562bdd4df20fe5f259","ja":"もっと腰を落とした方がいいかな……？\nこんな感じで……。","zh":"重心是不是应该再放低一点呢……？\n像这样……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1167.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"75f9310e7ed5fddea6418b99be170916aa543edfb4e6a318d50955a1d87d482d","ja":"お疲れ～……あれっ、昴、何してんの？\n撮影のポーズの練習？","zh":"辛苦啦～……咦，昴，你在做什么呢？\n是在练习拍照的姿势吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1167.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"066c1cef5e66990c39d3e28973756ee2f0cbedb48e8116300d5c0a68964a99cd","ja":"違うよ、シャドーピッチング！\nフォームの確認してたんだ！","zh":"不是啦，是在做无球投球练习！\n我是在确认姿势啦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1167.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"b9a775e1a6962a2fdfd05e5e8df6dec5a1ab804ac8f94e9cd3674918d8b1a640","ja":"今度バッティングセンターでストラックアウト大会が\nあるからさ、できるだけ練習したくて！","zh":"下次击球中心会有九宫格投球比赛，\n所以我想尽量多练习练习！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1167.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"56eb61fac7c668bb6e54b7b00156f77bea5ebc216c9a80d6ba4c58e5cd428ac6","ja":"へぇ～、気合い入ってるね！","zh":"哎～，干劲十足嘛！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1167.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"5b274d7de0ced0eaeb80feaf12360c2ff63fd42745a1f6c019b96820b5486065","ja":"うん！　なんたって優勝賞品が、オレの好きな\nピッチャーが出る試合のエキサイトシートなんだ！","zh":"嗯！毕竟冠军奖品可是我喜欢的\n投手出场比赛的Exciting Seat呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1167.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"f0d8e10db3858ccdaf8561c5e41762755308a1cf51c6dd04ad7b55b0e521eec2","ja":"えっ！　それって、なんかすごい席なんだよね！？","zh":"诶！那个座位，难道不是很厉害的吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1167.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"146104322ec2911e59d893485d8e7a90697b964a0f29f077a6152dca7b759a08","ja":"ああ！　試合がすっげー近くで見れて、\n選手たちが通りかかってくれたりもするんだぜ！","zh":"啊！比赛能在超近的地方看，\n选手们还会从身边经过呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1167.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"b455201c0a25e45ea8061351221b4806f8f9857e24b975ac3b546026ee0ec54f","ja":"プロレスのリングサイド席みたいなもんだよね？\nそれ、最高じゃん！","zh":"就像是职业摔角擂台边的前排座位一样对吧？\n那不是超棒的吗！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1167.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"d771e50493c4411e79c5910404a63348b0fb69065bc5a2b066c184798f6d8e71","ja":"よしっ！　なんかアタシに手伝えることあったら\n言ってよ！　ボール拾いでもなんでもするからさ♪","zh":"好嘞！要是有什么我能帮上忙的\n尽管说哦！捡球什么的我都愿意干♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1167.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"1e83fc99fb211591d9a5477fd166319ad114db2c916fe0e28209cd587d7313ae","ja":"ホントか！？　すっげー助かるよー！\nじゃあ早速、キャッチボールで肩を作って……。","zh":"真的吗！？太帮大忙啦——！\n那事不宜迟，先来传接球活动活动肩膀……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1167.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"426a2db247d4857a75e070ff12e47b5ac819c7e350feba8871106e34126d62db","ja":"待って、ここで！？\nまた琴葉とか紬とかに怒られちゃうよ！","zh":"等等，在这里吗！？\n又会被琴叶和紬她们骂的啦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1167.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"41e60407cb87e8950d45507de1ad9b65f118b05c1b00290854015f4637070ad6","ja":"ほら、場所移動しよ！\n外の方が練習しやすいだろうしさ！","zh":"快点，换个地方吧！\n在外面也比较方便练习嘛！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
